{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01660",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.68,
      "end_seconds": 5.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.18,
      "end_seconds": 12.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.96,
      "end_seconds": 23.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Well, I've been having trouble falling asleep. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.08,
      "end_seconds": 28.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.55,
      "end_seconds": 33.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "It's been about three months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.17,
      "end_seconds": 42.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.99,
      "end_seconds": 61.43,
      "duration_seconds": 16.44,
      "text": "pretty severe, if I'm being honest only a warm bath, and it's not much i've been waking tired too i did have a busy mind at night at one point, but that's gone now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.55,
      "end_seconds": 67.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Have you had trouble falling asleep before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.77,
      "end_seconds": 75.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last winter it went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.08,
      "end_seconds": 80.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "A few quick ones: low mood, chest pain or snoring?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.31,
      "end_seconds": 86.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "actually, no low mood, chest pain or snoring, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.31,
      "end_seconds": 90.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Has there been any weight change?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.8,
      "end_seconds": 94.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "definitely no weight change"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.72,
      "end_seconds": 100.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.43,
      "end_seconds": 103.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.73,
      "end_seconds": 108.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.53,
      "end_seconds": 111.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.8,
      "end_seconds": 116.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.89,
      "end_seconds": 128.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Clopidogrel. I take it 75 milligrams, maybe, once a day for the stent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.38,
      "end_seconds": 133.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Is the the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.66,
      "end_seconds": 144.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.26,
      "text": "Actually, not with me. I'll bring it next time. I'm on a herbal sleep tea, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.4,
      "end_seconds": 163.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right, are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.57,
      "end_seconds": 167.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "my daughter has type 1 diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.61,
      "end_seconds": 174.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.79,
      "end_seconds": 180.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "yes, amoxicillin. I get a rash all over"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.53,
      "end_seconds": 185.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.6,
      "end_seconds": 196.52,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation five years ago. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.23,
      "end_seconds": 199.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.08,
      "end_seconds": 205.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.46,
      "end_seconds": 210.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.67,
      "end_seconds": 215.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.38,
      "end_seconds": 229.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.11,
      "end_seconds": 235.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I have heart disease, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.12,
      "end_seconds": 248.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.55,
      "end_seconds": 262.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.91,
      "end_seconds": 294.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.14,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 15, temp 36.8 degrees, pulse is 66 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pressure 115 over 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.76,
      "end_seconds": 296.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.14,
      "end_seconds": 303.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.44,
      "end_seconds": 308.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.14,
      "end_seconds": 312.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.66,
      "end_seconds": 322.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Your blood pressure and pulse are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.54,
      "end_seconds": 336.54,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "So, good, you can sit up again. So where does that leave us? I'd lean towards poor sleep habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.19,
      "end_seconds": 340.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.5,
      "end_seconds": 363.11,
      "duration_seconds": 21.61,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like poor sleep habits keep a fixed bedtime, no screens for an hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.34,
      "end_seconds": 369.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.62,
      "end_seconds": 378.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.32,
      "end_seconds": 383.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.56,
      "end_seconds": 391.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Please come and see me in four weeks. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.83,
      "end_seconds": 393.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}